      "content": "<p><span><b><i>Someone has responded to </i></b></span><span><b><i><span class=\"field-token function-table-token\" contenteditable=\"false\" data-field-name=\"Customize_TitleText\" title=\"Customize_TitleText\" draggable=\"true\">&lt;&lt;Customize_TitleText&gt;&gt;</span></i></b></span><span><b><i>.</i></b></span></p><p></p><p><span><b><i>To see the latest results </i></b></span><span style=\"color:#000080\"><b><i><u><span contenteditable=\"false\" class=\"invitation-token\" data-invitation-config=\"{&quot;form&quot;:&quot;Administration&quot;,&quot;project&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;displayText&quot;:&quot;click here&quot;,&quot;isPrivate&quot;:false,&quot;authToken&quot;:&quot;&quot;}\" style=\"color:#000080;text-decoration:underline\">click here</span></u></i></b></span><span><b><i>.</i></b></span></p><p></p><p><span><b><i>Thank you for using Tawala!</i></b></span></p>"
    }
  ],
